            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize="10" bold="false" fontcolor="#173347">Recorded ÷ expected serious crashes, where expected comes from each crash's remoteness and speed zone. Colour shows whether an area is outside the 95% or 99.8% funnel limits, which narrow as areas get larger. Use the filter to choose council areas, police districts or state electorates. These are areas to investigate, not rankings.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone x="1200" y="13600" w="40950" h="85200" id="71" name="Areas against their road mix (funnel)" show-title="true" />
