            <formatted-text>
              <run fontsize="10" bold="false" fontcolor="#173347">Calculated in the notebook and unaffected by filters. Recorded ÷ expected compares each region with its road mix. Matched odds compare crashes within year and police region (grouped tables); adjusted odds hold road setting, time, region and year constant for each crash. Hover for 95% intervals.</run>
            </formatted-text>
          </zone>
          <zone x="1200" y="13600" w="32133" h="42300" id="77" name="Region severity and road mix 2020–2024" show-title="true" />
